      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE_IR → H3 prompt\n\n1. Write what the image actually shows in Image IR (write). One attribute per line:\n     =  observed        subject.gaze = toward camera\n     ~  uncertain       wardrobe.top_material ~ smooth | satin, silk\n     !  absent          subject.jewellery !\n2. Image IR Inspect shows what the document licenses, and which rule 6 micro-motions it can carry.\n3. Image IR Prompt Engine composes H1 / H2 / H3 from those facts and nothing else. An uncertain\n   attribute comes out hedged (\"smooth blouse\"), never resolved (\"satin blouse\").\n4. Image IR Grounding Guard re-checks the finished text. Chain it last: the engine audits itself,\n   but anything edited or concatenated after it has no such guarantee.\n\nPlug h3_prompt into CLIP Text Encode, or into whatever your video model takes as its prompt.\nPut duration / aspect / render style in `directives` — not a description of the image."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
